#    1     - Global styles (always Continue)
##   1.1   --- Notes
###  1.1.1 ----- Overview
# Filter for SSF
# default font size for all items 33
###  1.1.2 ----- Tiers
# Tiers split into 11: 8 tiers for show items, 3 tiers for hidden items, and 8 for items without sound icon and playeffect
# 1 tier: show, font 45, sound, minimapicon 0, playeffect
# 2 tier: show, font 45, sound, minimapicon 1, playeffect temp
# 3 tier: show, font 45, sound, minimapicon 2
# 4 tier: show, font 45
# 5 tier: show, font 42
# 6 tier: show, font 39
# 7 tier: show, font 36
# 8 tier: show, font 33
# 9 tier: hide, font 30
#10 tier: hide, font 24
#11 tier: hide, font 18
###  1.1.3 ----- Icons
# Orange Circle          - Currency Basic
# Orange Diamond         - Currency Catalyst
# Orange Raindrop        - Currency Oils
# Grey   Square          - Divination Cards
# White  Square          - Tier 1-5 Maps
# Yellow Square          - Tier 6-10 Maps
# Red    Square          - Tier 11-15 Maps
# Brown  Moon            - Unique Belts
# Brown  Diamond         - Unique Amulet, Rings
# Brown  UpsideDownHouse - Unique Off-hands
# Brown  Star            - Uniques Jewels
# Brown  Raindrop        - Unique Flasks
# Cyan   Raindrop        - Fractured Items
# Green  Raindrop        - Utility Flasks
# Red    Raindrop        - Life Flasks
# Blue   Raindrop        - Mana Flasks
# Green  Cross         - Quest related
###  1.1.4 ----- Sounds
# homm3snd/Disease.wav      - Trash Uniques
# homm3snd/BUTTON.wav       - Currency LOW T2
# homm3snd/Chat.wav         - Currency LOW T1
# homm3snd/FLAGMINE.wav     - Currency MID T3
# homm3snd/Age.wav          - Currency MID T2
# homm3snd/SysMsg.wav       - Currency MID T1
# homm3snd/LUCK.wav         - Currency TOP T3
# homm3snd/TREASURE.wav     - Currency TOP T2
# homm3snd/Faerie.wav       - Currency TOP T1
# homm3snd/UltimateArtifact - Currency T0 and God Tier Items
# homm3snd/BIND.wav         - Low Essences
# homm3snd/Dragon.wav       - High Essences
# homm3snd/Graveyard.wav    - Logbooks
# homm3snd/GetProtection.wav- Guardian Maps
# homm3snd/DEFAULT.wav      - Quest Campaign
# homm3snd/QUEST.wav        - Quest Atlas
